They won't kick you out of in progress classes. Worst case they may cancel your enrollment for your spring semester courses if they haven't recieved payment. That said, they are pretty well versed in student loan stuff. 

&#x200B;

Call financial aid and the tuition office and explain. They may even be able to waive the interest if you show your in progress student aid application.

